GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/b8713bc1-2834-4a1a-b594-ff73be15e7b8/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove the photo of a recipe
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/b8713bc1-2834-4a1a-b594-ff73be15e7b8/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archive a recipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/b29930bb-2e91-4a68-b5a9-ea127b39b054/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

