GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/b8713bc1-2834-4a1a-b594-ff73be15e7b8/scaled?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cost of N loaves on a price date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/b8713bc1-2834-4a1a-b594-ff73be15e7b8/cost?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stage timeline and ready window for a start time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/b8713bc1-2834-4a1a-b594-ff73be15e7b8/timeline?start=2026-11-26T08%3A00%3A00%2B02%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start window for a desired ready time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/b8713bc1-2834-4a1a-b594-ff73be15e7b8/start-window?readyAt=2026-11-27T08%3A00%3A00%2B02%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

